ion","bytes":9506},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/jan/images/06_0165_02.gif","alt":"Map of the United States showing location of the StrongWomen program. Thirty-five states (plus Ontario, Canada, which is not shown] have active StrongWomen Program classes, including Alabama, Alaska, Arkansas, California, Colorado, Connecticut, Florida, Idaho, Indiana, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Maine, Maryland, Massachusetts, Michigan, Mississippi, Missouri, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New Mexico, New York, North Carolina, North Dakota, Ohio, Oklahoma, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Vermont, Virginia, Washington, West Virginia, Wisconsin, and Wyoming. Eleven states have active classes and have been the site of at least one workshop: Alaska, Arkansas, Colorado, Kansas, Massachusetts, Mississippi, Ohio, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Tennessee, and Wisconsin.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":443,"renderedHeight":286,"naturalWidth":443,"naturalHeight":286,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"TOO_LONG","altReason":"alt text is 801 characters — consider a caption or description","bytes":9851},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/jan/www.cdc.gov/navimages/spacer.gif","alt":" ","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":140,"renderedHeight":1,"naturalWidth":null,"naturalHeight":null,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"DECORATIVE","altReason":"alt=\"\" (decorative)","bytes":20905},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/jan/www.cdc.gov/navimages/spacer.gif","alt":" ","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":12,"renderedHeight":1,"naturalWidth":null,"naturalHeight":null,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"DECORATIVE","altReason":"alt=\"\" (decorative)","bytes":20905},{"src":"https:/